This package contains model files derived from dragonkue/multilingual-e5-small-ko-v2
(https://huggingface.co/dragonkue/multilingual-e5-small-ko-v2,
revision fcfc26bf355882620c48df58be112275bd756f50), which its model card licenses under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. A copy of that license is in LICENSE.

Changes made to the original:
- The safetensors weights were exported to ONNX with optimum 2.1.0 (optimum-onnx 0.1.0,
  transformers 4.57.6, torch 2.15.0+cpu, onnx 1.23.2).
- The ONNX model was quantized with onnxruntime 1.32.0 quantize_dynamic (QUInt8 weights)
  and saved as onnx/model_quantized.onnx. The fp32 ONNX model is not included.
- config.json, tokenizer.json, tokenizer_config.json and special_tokens_map.json were
  written by the same tools from the original repository at the revision above.
The exact build is reproduced by build.py and requirements.txt in
https://github.com/jee1/memento/tree/main/models/memento-embedding-e5-small-ko-v2 and checked
against sha256.json there.

The original model is fine-tuned from intfloat/multilingual-e5-small
(https://huggingface.co/intfloat/multilingual-e5-small,
revision 614241f622f53c4eeff9890bdc4f31cfecc418b3), which its model card licenses under the
